A1. Dog wagon. ~ ROLLSROYCE
A10. This is black and white. ~ GRAY
A14. The cry of the bacchanal—whoops! ~ EVOE
A15. New York's gift to the X-word puzzle ~ OLEAN
A16. Girl's name. ~ LOLA
A17. The dope. ~ DATA
A18. Old saw. ~ ADAGE
A19. A split-up in the laboratory. ~ ATOM
A20. What he picked up off the floor. ~ SLIVER
A22. What the doctor ordered (plur.). ~ REMEDIES
A24. Assam silkworm. ~ ERIA
A26. Turned red. ~ DYED
A27. What they're doing in the pineapple factories nowadays. ~ CANNING
A30. A ride that leaves us cold. ~ SLEIGH
A34. High Cost of Osculation, you know how. ~ HCO
A35. Sprinkled with hen fruit. ~ EGGED
A38. Queen of the kitchen. ~ NORA
A39. A la Flagpole Kelly. ~ ATOP
A41. This was in the papers only yesterday. ~ ITEM
A43. A shiner. ~ STAR
A44. What he felt after a shower. ~ ROSIE
A46. This is brilliant in France. ~ ECLAT
A48. You can't make a monkey out of this. ~ APE
