D33. Fast steppers. ~ HARES
D36. An artistic scratch. ~ ETCH
D37. A hold up. ~ DELAY
D40. This gets around a little girl. ~ PINAFORE
D42. When Greek met Greek this took place. ~ MARATHON
D45. A shade of Java. ~ ECRU
